<title>USA: Citicorp Q1 EPS rose 15 pct to $2.01.</title>
<headline>Citicorp Q1 EPS rose 15 pct to $2.01.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Quarter (Dollars in Mlns,	1997	1996  Change</p>
<p>except EPS)</p>
<p>Adjusted Revenue			   $5,627    $5,117    10%</p>
<p>Net Income					995	 914     9%</p>
<p>Earnings Per Share (Fully Diluted)    $2.01     $1.75    15%</p>
<p>Return on Common Equity (%)		20.8	20.2	-</p>
<p>Return on Assets (%)			 1.41	1.37	-</p>
<p>Avg shrs outstanding (Fully Diluted)  476.0     500.8	-</p>
<p>NOTE: 1997 Q1 results were $2.09 excluding a previously disclosed incremental $60 million pretax charge for performance-based options.</p>
</text>
